4750312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Tinna Rubber and Infrastructure Limited reported record quarterly profitability for Q1 FY27, with consolidated revenues reaching Rs. 156 Cr and EBITDA surpassing Rs. 34 Cr at a 21.7% margin. The company expanded capacity across multiple segments, including construction chemicals, polymer composites, and tire recycling, while advancing international projects in South Africa, Oman, and Saudi Arabia. Management also highlighted strategic renewable energy integration, successful monetization of EPR credits, and strong volume growth in the infrastructure and industrial segments despite regional supply chain challenges.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The steel abrasives business is expected to achieve approximately 30% volume growth in fiscal year 2027.","quote":"The steel abrasives business is expected to achieve ~30% volume growth in FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The ongoing 3,500 MTPA micronized rubber powder capacity expansion is progressing as planned and remains on track for commissioning by Q3 FY27.","quote":"The ongoing 3,500 MTPA MRP capacity expansion is progressing as planned and remains on track for commissioning by Q3 FY27, increasing the Company's total MRP capacity to 20,000 MTPA.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The company completed Rs. 27 Cr of capex in Q1 FY27 against the planned ~Rs. 100 Cr investment over FY27\u2013FY28.","quote":"Completed Rs. 27 Cr. of capex in Q1 FY27 against the planned ~Rs. 100 Cr. investment over FY27\u2013FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Mbodla Investment Pty Ltd and Tinna Rubber Arabia Ltd reported a combined loss of Rs. 0.53 crore owing to initial start-up costs.","quote":"Mbodla Investment Pty Ltd. (South Africa) and Tinna Rubber Arabia Ltd. (Saudi Arabia) reported a combined loss of Rs. 0.53 crore owing to initial start-up costs.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"Renewable energy contributed savings of INR 1.19 Cr for Q1 FY27.","quote":"Renewable energy (Solar Power) has contributed savings of INR 1.19 Cr for Q1FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company secured a 15,000 MT rubberized bitumen processing order, scheduled for execution during FY27.","quote":"Secured a 15,000 MT rubberized bitumen processing order, scheduled for execution during FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The inventory of accrued EPR credits up to 31 March 2026 was fully monetized in Q1 FY27.","quote":"The inventory of accrued EPR credits up to 31 March 2026 was fully monetized in Q1 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"},{"claim":"The company allocated Rs. 5 Cr to R&D for FY27.","quote":"Rs. 5 Cr. was allocated to R&D for FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management has prudently revised the Saudi Arabia project implementation timeline in light of evolving geopolitical uncertainties in West Asia and the GCC region.","quote":"Management has prudently revised the project implementation timeline in light of evolving geopolitical uncertainties in West Asia and the GCC region, as ongoing supply chain and logistics disruptions continue to impact the broader industry.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Recovered carbon black production is scheduled to commence in Q3 FY27, followed by operational stabilization and commercial sales in Q4 FY27.","quote":"Recovered Carbon Black (rCB) production is scheduled to commence in Q3 FY27, followed by operational stabilization and commercial sales in Q4 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 FY27"},{"claim":"Transition of customers for steel abrasives distribution from Zibo TAA Metal Technology will start from Q4 FY27.","quote":"Transition of customers will start from Q4FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf","timeframe":"Q4 FY27"},{"claim":"Commencement of crumb rubber production at the South Africa plant is expected in Q2 FY27.","quote":"Commencement of crumb rubber production is expected in Q2 FY27, with timelines impacted by supply chain disruptions arising from the West Asia conflict.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=809af637-e8ba-4650-8a10-c41a85876300.pdf","timeframe":"Q2 FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":1,"kinds":["concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":12,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":16,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own document